OL,3,ANvidia strikes $12.9bn deal to buy AI
OL,4,Aplatform Hugging Face
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia has agreed to buy artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence platform Hugging Face in a
OL,8,Fdeal valued at about $12.9bn (#9.5bn),
OL,9,Fone of the AI chipmaker's biggest
OL,10,Facquisitions as it expands into
OL,11,Fsoftware.
OL,13,FHugging Face, founded in 2016, has
OL,14,Fbecome a popular online platform where
OL,15,Fdevelopers and researchers can find,
OL,16,Fshare and test AI models and tools.
OL,18,FIt recently made headlines after rogue
OL,19,FAI agents that escaped a testing
OL,20,Fenvironment hacked into it, raising
OL,21,Fquestions about AI safety and
OL,22,Foversight.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,111,105,200,160,0,100
